// The guided programme editor: for every policy area (policy-rules.js POLICY_AREAS, all 34, none left out) three themes, each with a title, a problem, an objective and concrete measures, written for that
// sector (a health measure is not a school measure). Everything is a pair [Italian, English]: the Italian is what the editor offers and what is stored when it is chosen, the English is the phrase-book
// (data/i18n/en-ui-8.js reads `ALL_PAIRS`). The player can always write his own text instead: a choice here is only a starting point and is stored as plain text in the proposal, so nothing in the saved
// data depends on this catalogue (older proposals are untouched). A measure also carries the instrument it belongs to (policy-rules.js INSTRUMENT_KINDS).
